 "notes": [
  "Brick white-referenced twice on 2116506 (Van Walbeeckstraat): overcast 2022-12 crop, brick #413631 against the white bay sill #746e65 -> #86756f; shaded wall of the sunlit 2020-05 crop #8a7764 against its shaded sill #b2bdac -> #ba9686 (the sunlit wall itself clips at ~250). Drawn #8c7870: the first contact sheet at #9a7c6e read pink-orange against the purple-brown photo, so chroma was reduced.",
  "Roof: the street sees orange-red pantiles under white dormers (2116506 2020-05, lit tile #e2a578-#f9af78, clipped); the PDOK orthophoto reads #8c8484 neutral over 128 pands (84 slate class), i.e. the back slopes and the grey-tiled blocks. Drawn #a5624a, the street-facing slope toned down from the clipped crop.",
  "Per 6.2 m pand: a canted bay (annex, 3 facets) from the ground to the top storey, and a door pair in a grey stone surround under two windows per storey. alternateMirror pairs bays with bays and entrances with entrances, as the photos show.",
